      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "古歌：“似觉神魂已失踪，心头漠漠意空空。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: It seems my spirit has already vanished; my heart is dim and empty.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03951",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "多因惜别心烦乱，落入伊人怀袖中。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Perhaps, because parting made my heart so troubled, it slipped into that person's robe and sleeves.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03951",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "见《古今和歌集》。",
